WEBVTT

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.150
Whoa.

00:00:20.529 --> 00:00:22.729
Sir, you're magnificent!

00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:24.988
Thank you, sycophant.

00:00:25.568 --> 00:00:27.568
Your admiration is inevitable.

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:38.619
I knew it!

00:00:39.119 --> 00:00:41.019
Just like the Stay Puft
Marshmallow Man.

00:00:42.479 --> 00:00:43.979
World Domination playlist.

00:00:44.091 --> 00:00:46.934
[heavy metal playing]

00:00:58.529 --> 00:00:59.529
Fall back.

00:01:00.684 --> 00:01:03.676
Fall back! Quick!
Retreat!

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:07.698
How are we supposed
to beat this thing?

00:01:07.698 --> 00:01:08.778
We need a plan.

00:01:09.139 --> 00:01:10.858
Knuckles,
use your strength to--

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.678
Jump off the plane. Wow.

00:01:14.258 --> 00:01:16.458
Okay, this is what
we're gonna do.
Step 1: Light taunting.

00:01:16.592 --> 00:01:19.093
Step 2: I have no idea.

00:01:22.979 --> 00:01:23.979
Sonic!

00:01:27.179 --> 00:01:29.078
[Sonic]
Nice action figure, Eggman.

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:31.799
Does it do anything
or just stand there
looking ugly?

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:38.159
Like a blister,
he keeps coming back!

00:01:39.518 --> 00:01:42.239
He's on the okay-to-kill list.
Shoot the missiles.
Make a decision.

00:01:42.459 --> 00:01:45.619
I need a moment, sir.
I'm trying to figure out
how to do this.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.357
Did you even glance
at a manual?

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:49.439
No!
I'll do it.

00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:50.979
Pardon my lightning.

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:52.799
You might want
to ground yourself.
[groaning]

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:56.788
Uh-oh.

00:01:56.788 --> 00:01:59.108
I'm gonna pop that thing open
like a can of chili--
[screams]

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:05.545
[Sonic] Whoa!

00:02:06.128 --> 00:02:07.128
[Tails] Hang on!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.311
Whoa!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.814
[grunting]

00:02:12.374 --> 00:02:14.379
Whoa! [laughs]

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:17.739
Whoo!
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:17.827 --> 00:02:20.127
Oh, yeah!
Whoo! Whoo-hoo-hoo!
Close one.

00:02:20.215 --> 00:02:22.043
[Sonic grunts]
Sonic!

00:02:25.079 --> 00:02:26.079
Robotnik!

00:02:28.299 --> 00:02:29.159
Deceiver!

00:02:29.159 --> 00:02:30.159
Die, mosquito.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:33.521
[panting]

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:35.070
[grunting]

00:02:40.547 --> 00:02:42.625
[yells]

00:02:42.739 --> 00:02:44.298
Ooh! I felt that.

00:02:51.196 --> 00:02:54.421
[growling]

00:02:56.848 --> 00:02:58.848
Oh! Whoa!

00:03:03.079 --> 00:03:04.459
What just happened?

00:03:05.039 --> 00:03:07.899
It's the Stache Masher.
Right here in the manual.

00:03:10.859 --> 00:03:12.518
Return to sender.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.231
[Robotnik, Stone grunt]

00:03:20.429 --> 00:03:21.429
Stone?

00:03:23.149 --> 00:03:24.149
Oh, great.

00:03:24.408 --> 00:03:27.209
Next thing you know,
there'll be a report about
a hostile work environment.

00:03:30.429 --> 00:03:33.529
Those were our best attacks,
and they did nothing!

00:03:33.689 --> 00:03:36.249
We can't beat Robotnik
as long as he's got
that Emerald.

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:37.589
He's too powerful.

00:03:37.869 --> 00:03:40.629
Look, we aren't strong enough
to beat Robotnik on our own.

00:03:40.749 --> 00:03:41.968
But there's three of us.

00:03:42.289 --> 00:03:45.449
Your strength, your smarts
and my speed.

00:03:45.609 --> 00:03:47.249
Together.
That's how we win.

00:03:47.649 --> 00:03:51.809
So we make our stand here
on the field of battle.

00:03:52.029 --> 00:03:53.029
As a team.

00:03:53.609 --> 00:03:54.609
This is it.

00:03:56.129 --> 00:03:58.589
This is our moment.

00:04:00.989 --> 00:04:02.268
Time to fight.

00:04:09.479 --> 00:04:12.819
Bad time to say this,
but I don't actually
have a plan.

00:04:14.279 --> 00:04:15.619
Tails, any ideas?

00:04:16.119 --> 00:04:17.558
We have to find
his weak spot.

00:04:18.039 --> 00:04:19.598
I suggest the groin.

00:04:19.718 --> 00:04:21.819
What? No. No!

00:04:21.979 --> 00:04:24.418
Traditionally, yes,
the groin is the weakest spot.

00:04:24.539 --> 00:04:26.539
Stop saying "groin."

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.428
[Robotnik] Hedgehog!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.981
Look out!

00:04:32.379 --> 00:04:34.919
I know what
his weak spot is.
It's me.

00:04:35.299 --> 00:04:36.698
I'm the groin!

00:04:37.492 --> 00:04:39.359
[Knuckles grunts]

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:40.699
Think about it.
Whoa!

00:04:40.699 --> 00:04:42.459
I live rent-free
in this dude's head.

00:04:42.579 --> 00:04:44.519
So if I go out there
and rile him up...

00:04:44.719 --> 00:04:46.999
He'll focus on only you,
leaving himself open

00:04:46.999 --> 00:04:49.319
to a flanking maneuver
from me and the fox!

00:04:49.559 --> 00:04:52.079
Hedgehog,
you are a brave
and noble warrior.

00:04:52.418 --> 00:04:54.838
Go to your certain death
with honor.

00:04:55.039 --> 00:04:56.718
We're gonna have to work
on your pep talks, pal.

00:04:57.558 --> 00:04:59.039
[laughs] Yeah.
Let's go.

00:05:03.329 --> 00:05:04.329
All right, mustache.

00:05:04.869 --> 00:05:07.389
You want me?
Come and get me.

00:05:07.929 --> 00:05:10.308
You don't tell me
about coming and getting.

00:05:10.669 --> 00:05:12.549
I am on the cutting edge
of coming and getting!

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:14.409
Coming, getting.

00:05:14.809 --> 00:05:19.269
Coming, getting.
Coming, getting.
Coming, getting.

00:05:21.579 --> 00:05:23.919
Oh, you're really heavy.

00:05:24.099 --> 00:05:28.159
That's because I am
one million percent muscle.
Faster, fox!

00:05:30.006 --> 00:05:33.256
Go! Move, guys! Move back!
Let's go, that's it!
Go, go, go!

00:05:33.359 --> 00:05:34.359
Keep going!
Go! Go!

00:05:34.445 --> 00:05:35.971
No, no! Stop!
Stop the truck!

00:05:36.058 --> 00:05:37.718
Tom,
what happened here?

00:05:38.699 --> 00:05:40.859
You thinking what
I'm thinking?
Let's get our kid.

00:05:41.218 --> 00:05:42.218
[both] We need your truck!

00:05:48.739 --> 00:05:50.258
[voice slowing]
Coming, getting.
Whew!

00:05:50.414 --> 00:05:53.040
[Sonic] Yoo-hoo!

00:05:53.199 --> 00:05:55.178
So what's
the plan here?
[panting]

00:05:55.287 --> 00:05:56.287
Huh?

00:05:56.385 --> 00:05:58.288
You gonna build
a big robot house?

00:05:58.399 --> 00:06:00.078
Get yourself
a big robot wife?

00:06:00.499 --> 00:06:04.839
I'm going to enslave humanity
and force them
to service my machines.

00:06:05.359 --> 00:06:07.719
First, Green Hills.
Then the universe.

00:06:07.999 --> 00:06:09.019
Then the multiverse.

00:06:09.239 --> 00:06:11.819
Then who knows?
Maybe that'll be enough.

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:13.638
Full disclosure?

00:06:14.718 --> 00:06:16.838
You won't be there.

00:06:21.979 --> 00:06:23.678
[grunts]
Eye lasers? Really?

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.799
[panting]

00:06:36.869 --> 00:06:37.869
Snot rocket!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.129
No, no, no!

00:06:42.824 --> 00:06:45.520
[screaming]

00:06:47.649 --> 00:06:49.128
[grunts]

00:06:49.259 --> 00:06:50.759
[laughing]
Giving up already?

00:06:51.379 --> 00:06:54.899
Not so tough
when you're fighting someone
700 times your size, are ya?

00:06:56.718 --> 00:06:59.119
You can't beat me!

00:06:59.879 --> 00:07:02.758
I'm all-powerful!
All-knowing!

00:07:05.639 --> 00:07:08.018
All-seeing.

00:07:08.539 --> 00:07:11.098
Looks like your fancy robot
has a glitch.

00:07:11.192 --> 00:07:13.243
[voice multiplying] Is it me?
What about me? I'm over here.

00:07:13.338 --> 00:07:14.915
Up top! Down below!
Behind you! [laughs]

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.935
[voices overlapping]
I'm over here.
Sorry! Over here.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.544
Too slow! Try again.

00:07:18.639 --> 00:07:20.659
You can't outsmart me.
Missed me again.

00:07:21.499 --> 00:07:22.819
I'm the outsmarter-er!

00:07:22.819 --> 00:07:23.819
[grunts]

00:07:23.823 --> 00:07:25.579
[yelping]

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:30.299
I didn't outsmart you.
I'm just the distraction.

00:07:30.919 --> 00:07:31.919
[Knuckles] Robotnik!

00:07:32.619 --> 00:07:35.099
I am also a hologram.

00:07:36.439 --> 00:07:37.439
Disloyal.

00:07:37.439 --> 00:07:40.039
"Dis" is how I roll.

00:07:41.048 --> 00:07:42.545
[yells]

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.425
[Robotnik groaning]

00:07:53.998 --> 00:07:56.852
[both screaming]

00:08:00.298 --> 00:08:02.282
[both grunting]

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.364
[gasping]

00:08:08.479 --> 00:08:09.558
Where's my Emerald?

00:08:10.507 --> 00:08:13.007
No, no, no, no!

00:08:13.158 --> 00:08:14.918
Computer, auxiliary power.

00:08:18.641 --> 00:08:20.485
[groans]

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.173
[gasps] Oh.

00:08:24.279 --> 00:08:26.638
The Emerald.
It's right there.

00:08:27.899 --> 00:08:29.319
Move, you hunk of junk!

00:08:34.378 --> 00:08:37.178
I have to... [groans]
...reach it.

00:08:38.015 --> 00:08:39.831
[groaning]

00:08:42.519 --> 00:08:43.916
[grunts]

